      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for freetype2 fixes the following issue\n\n- Update to version 2.14.3\n- CVE-2026-50811: out-of-bounds read vulnerabilityin src/truetype/ttgxvar.c in the TT_Get_Var_Design implementation used by FT_Get_Var_Design_Coordinates (bsc#1271045).\n",
